Modifications:
The web application in webapp/ is a subset of the built drawio.war release
artifact v32.6.1. Files not required for the embedded editor were omitted
(Java web-application scaffolding, development sources, viewer and
cloud-integration bundles, template gallery, MathJax v4 assets and all message
catalogs except English and German). In js/PreConfig.js the DRAW_MATH_URL was
set to null to match the omitted MathJax assets. See README.md for the exact
inventory and the SHA-256 of the release artifact.

The bpmn.io watermark obligations of the separately licensed bpmn-js library
do not apply to these files; the diagram editor's own branding is retained as
shipped by upstream.

Icon and stencil libraries shipped inside webapp/ remain subject to the
additional terms stated in the upstream drawio README (no reuse as software
assets in Atlassian products or marketplaces, including traced reproductions
or AI-generated images created from them).
